}}'''Clownfish (Knife)''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was obtainable in the [[Summer Event 2024]] by collecting 250 '''Beach Balls''' {{Currency|Beach Ball}} and purchasing the 2nd tier or through trading. It Is now only obtainable though trading as the event has ended

== Appearance ==
The knife's blade is colored in a white-orange pattern like a clownfish, hence the name. The handle, on the other side, is a black color.

== Trivia ==

* It has a [[Clownfish (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name.

